<section id="S7" class="ltx_section">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_section"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_section">7 </span>Prompted Segmentation</h3>

<div id="S7.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S7.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#S7.T3" title="Table 3 ‣ 7 Prompted Segmentation ‣ Curia: A Multi-Modal Foundation Model for Radiology" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a> presents the detailed results of the prompted segmentation, reported per organ.</p>
</div>
<figure id="S7.T3" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="S7.T3.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 3</span>: </span><span id="S7.T3.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Results on the AMOS Dataset for Prompted Organ Segmentation.<span id="S7.T3.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> For each model, we report the mean Dice Similarity Coefficient (DSC) computed per organ. Both bounding box (Bbox) and point-based prompts are considered in the evaluation.</span></span></figcaption>
