<section id="S8" class="ltx_section">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_section"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_section">8 </span>Detailed Results</h3>

<section id="S8.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">8.1 </span>Registration</h4>

<div id="S8.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S8.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">This section showcases the results on the <span id="S8.SS1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">image registration</span> benchmark. More specifically, Table <a href="#S8.T4" title="Table 4 ‣ 8.1 Registration ‣ 8 Detailed Results ‣ Curia: A Multi-Modal Foundation Model for Radiology" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a> shows the results on Learn2Reg Abdomen, Table <a href="#S8.T5" title="Table 5 ‣ 8.1 Registration ‣ 8 Detailed Results ‣ Curia: A Multi-Modal Foundation Model for Radiology" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a> the results on Learn2Reg Brain, and Table <a href="#S8.T6" title="Table 6 ‣ 8.1 Registration ‣ 8 Detailed Results ‣ Curia: A Multi-Modal Foundation Model for Radiology" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a> the results on XCAT.</p>
</div>
