<section id="S9" class="ltx_section">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_section"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_section">9 </span>Detailed Scores by Benchmark</h3>

<section id="S9.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">9.1 </span>Bootstrapping Scores</h4>

<div id="S9.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S9.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In this section, we display the detailed scores for each benchmark obtained through non-parametric bootstrapping. Specifically, we report the average value of the main metric along with the corresponding 95% confidence intervals.</p>
</div>
<figure id="S9.T8" class="ltx_table">
