<section id="S9.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">9.2 </span>Statistical Significance</h4>

<div id="S9.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S9.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In this section, we present the results of statistical significance tests performed using a paired bootstrap approach across five training runs. Specifically, for each pair of models and for each benchmark, we report the computed p-value as well as the 95% confidence interval (in %) of the main metric, derived from the paired bootstrap distribution.</p>
</div>
<figure id="S9.T25" class="ltx_table">
